      <h1 class="tw-thesis__title" id="page-title">How the Loch keeps a payment private.</h1>
      <p class="tw-thesis__lede">The technical version: what is hashed, what is proved, what is encrypted, and what an observer still sees. The plain version is on <router-link to="/#private">the start page</router-link>.</p>
